  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Lengthening</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An everyday mascara that defines, separates, and lengthens lashes for a wide-awake look with no smudging ever.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lengthening<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Proprietary Tubing Film-Formers: Define, separate, and lift lashes without clumping.<br>- Plant-Derived Rice Bran Wax: Adds structure and length to lashes. <br>- Fatty Acids and Olive Oil Esters: Nourish and condition lashes. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Meet your go-to mascara for every day. Designed to distribute the perfect amount of product, the defining brush lifts lashes while ensuring your look never clumps or flakes.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Comb through lashes, wiggling the brush at the base to add thickness to your lash line. <br>-To remove, wash with cleanser and warm water.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;\">Ingredients: Water (Aqua/Eau), Acrylates/Ethylhexyl Acrylate Copolymer, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Wax, Hydrogenated Olive Oil Stearyl Esters, Acrylates Copolymer, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Cire de carnauba), Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax (Euphorbia Cerifera Cera/Cire de candelilla), Acacia Senegal Gum, PVP, Palmitic Acid, Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Tromethamine, Glycerin, Steareth-20, Cetearyl Alcohol, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Simethicone, Laureth-21, Steareth-2, Panthenol, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium dehydroacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ethyl Hexanediol, Sodium Benzoate, Benzyl Alcohol, Tocopherol; may contain/peut contenir (+/-): CI 77491/CI 77492/CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide).</span></p></div></details>",
